# route: level=w3_l1b_coop difficulty=beginner players=2 ends=exit after=tally expect=wipes:0,eggs:0,x2_gates:2,painting:25
# w3_l1b_coop Beginner two-stream route: "Blizzard Pass" for two (designer DB2; ticks:P1|P2; recorded from closed-loop
# duo bots, build/db2/bot_w3_l1b_coop.gd --ledge=1). Every jump waits for a lull that lasts, the waiting partner
# crouches through the gusts, nobody crouches while sliding on ice. A Shellback pincer at the cave mouth; the crevasse
# of pillars (walked to each edge crouching in the gusts) and the pond's floes (P1 waits on the last floe until the
# ridge charger has run past into the pond); up to the shelter ridge; the x2 secret 'lee': P2 stands right of the
# ledge, P1 hops off his head in a lull, rides the bounce clear of the ledge's underside and lands on it (painting 25),
# then drops off its right end; over the ice bridge with a run-up; gate 'hut': P1 drops into the keeper hall through
# the first hole (bait), P2 through the second and clubs the first turtle's back; then P2 baits the second one while
# P1 climbs the vine, crosses the crust and drops behind it; the door opens.
